$text.="## G. Remaining work and dependencies\n\n- Authentic property photographs, actual tour media and verified real listing data have not been supplied.\n- Live bKash/cards, SMS, phone, push, bank transfer verification and provider/owner payouts are not configured. Only explicit manual review/confirmation is operational.\n- The agreement is a sample typed-consent template; reviewed real agreements and an appropriate production signing integration are still needed. Police/identity records are reviewed locally, without a real external identity check.\n- Inspection repair decisions do not yet generate a complete owner-approved provider repair/invoice chain automatically.\n- Catering subscriptions/rosters exist; daily delivery records, outcome confirmation, cancellation/refund adjustments and recurring fulfillment remain incomplete. Grocery customer confirmation and inventory/stock controls need extension.\n- Move-out notice and inspection timing work; deposit refunds, adjustments, damage agreement and final settlement are incomplete. Head-tenant transfer requires further contract and financial reassignment verification.\n- Cross-role room listings require a dedicated authority/owner-consent workflow. Provider-specific navigation, customer cancellation, appointment slot capacity, declines and urgent escalation need further implementation.\n- Complete browser journeys for grocery and catering providers, role matrix tests, OTP expiry/lockout boundaries, referral rules and scheduler idempotency still need expanded coverage.\n- Scheduled jobs run manually/startup; install a reliable production scheduler, HTTPS, backups, retention policies and production operational monitoring before public use.\n\n";
$text.="## H. Run and reproduce\n\nRun `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/start.ps1`, then open http://127.0.0.1:8000. On an existing database run `E:\\Xamppp\\php\\php.exe server/migrate.php` and `npm run build`. Run `npm test`, `node tools/ui-qa.cjs`, and `node tools/priority-ui-qa.cjs`. Local demo emails are owner, tenant, provider, agent, supervisor, finance and field_agent at @rentguardian.local, password Guardian@2026!. Admin credentials remain in ignored storage/credentials.md. These are local sample accounts only.\n\nThe API journey test demonstrates owner listing → agent inspection with OTP → supervisor approval/publication → tenant viewing → application → private police document → signatures → separate advance invoice → independent review and finance confirmation → active tenancy → move-out notice/inspection scheduling. The browser priority test demonstrates draft recovery, review, actual persistence and photo management. See docs/demo-testing.md for other existing local scenarios.\n";
